      "text": "The irony of this statement is thick.\n\nFor one, PowerShell can run any command ( on Windows or Unix ).\n\nFor another, much bigger point:\n\nPowerShell is inherently faster and more capable than Bash.\n\nBash doesn't have threading or background jobs.\n\nLike comparing apples and apricots."
